# Tambah 20 provinsi Indonesia (OCST) lewat Service Layer. JALANKAN MANUAL, urut 1 -> 2 -> 3.
# Bisa langsung diklik "Send Request" dengan extension VS Code REST Client (cookie login otomatis dipakai ulang).
# JTM (JAWA TIMUR) tidak ikut karena sudah ada. Semua dalam satu changeset: kalau satu gagal, semuanya batal.

@sl = https://192.168.40.197:50000/b1s/v1

### 1. Login
POST {{sl}}/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{"CompanyDB":"CVPPM","UserName":"manager","Password":"1234"}

### 2. Tambah 20 provinsi (hasil yang benar: 20x "HTTP/1.1 201 Created")
POST {{sl}}/$batch
Content-Type: multipart/mixed;boundary=batch_states

--batch_states
Content-Type: multipart/mixed;boundary=changeset_states

--changeset_states
Content-Type: application/http
Content-Transfer-Encoding: binary

POST /b1s/v1/States
Content-Type: application/json

{"Code":"BLI","Country":"ID","Name":"BALI"}

--changeset_states
Content-Type: application/http
Content-Transfer-Encoding: binary

POST /b1s/v1/States
Content-Type: application/json

{"Code":"BTN","Country":"ID","Name":"BANTEN"}

