### 3. Cek hasil (harus 21 baris termasuk JTM)
GET {{sl}}/States?$filter=Country eq 'ID'&$orderby=Code&$select=Code,Name
Prefer: odata.maxpagesize=100

### 4. Logout
POST {{sl}}/Logout
